  "description": "Every day he seems to be getting stronger. Something powerful must be driving the Mysterious Knight’s ambitions as he seems to grow in strength quite rapidly. There are days where he goes off into the forests to train, and does not allow anyone to follow him. Nobody knows what he does out there, but after every day he seems more determined to accomplish his goal. As long as he is loyal to Arthur, the other knights tolerate his behavior. However, one cannot stop but think what this Mysterious Knight’s true intentions really are…",
